WEBVTT

00:11:59.626 --> 00:12:01.244
alongside our honeybees.

00:12:01.244 --> 00:12:03.667
We need all of our bees.

00:12:03.667 --> 00:12:06.208
So what are we going to do?

00:12:06.208 --> 00:12:08.622
What are we going to do about this big bee bummer

00:12:08.622 --> 00:12:10.885
that we've created?

00:12:10.885 --> 00:12:14.702
It turns out, it's hopeful. It's hopeful.

00:12:14.702 --> 00:12:18.285
Every one of you out there can help bees

00:12:18.285 --> 00:12:22.750
in two very direct and easy ways.

00:12:22.750 --> 00:12:25.705
Plant bee-friendly flowers,

00:12:25.705 --> 00:12:27.838
and don't contaminate these flowers,

00:12:27.838 --> 00:12:30.500
this bee food, with pesticides.